    "-- Summary: Apply a symmetric steam-only differential to an untrimmed common-demand map. Equal verified raw-lift capacity in all four quadrants lets paired integer offsets preserve requested total support exactly. A single shared scale honors the tightest provider/floor/quadrant-capacity bound.\010",
    "function Flight:applyCoarseSteamTrim(io,baseMaps,model,now)\013\010",
    "    local result={}\013\010",
    "    for _,q in ipairs(QUADS) do\013\010",
